This standalone seed extracts and extends MatlowAI's conditional least-squares
solver from its delta-surgery research code. MatlowAI has released the files in
this repository under the MIT License. This release does not change the license
of the separate original research package or any third-party models/software.

The generated comparison illustrations are included as educational examples.
No model weights, reference photographs, face embeddings, or training data are
included. The source checkpoints and reference set used for the historical
measurements are private, so those image scores cannot be recomputed from this
repository alone. The synthetic demo and solver tests are independently runnable.
